Run.Description Constant-energy ARPES map of hBN at E = -3.5 eV over the first BZ
Run.Prefix generate

Run.TypeOfSystem Graphene
TB.Hopping 2.88945

Structure.LatticeParameter 2.505
Structure.CellSize 1
Structure.SuperCell 1

# hBN as a honeycomb of two different atoms: the sublattice mass of 4.98 eV is the on-site
# energy difference of the B and N atoms of Run.TypeOfSystem BoronNitride (TB.OnSiteB 3.09
# minus TB.OnSiteN -1.89), and TB.Hopping is the BN hopping -3.11*a + 10.68 of that model at
# a = 2.505 Angstrom. BoronNitride itself cannot be used here: its atoms are Species 3 and 4,
# and the photoemission weights of Spectral.WeiKu are only implemented for Species 1 and 2, so
# every spectral file would hold zeros.
Potential.AddSublatticeMassterm .true.
Potential.SublatticeMassterm 4.98

Kubo.Calc .false.
Diag.Calc .true.

# Constant-energy map I(kx,ky): the grid is Diag.KGrid points per direction inside a square of
# half-width Spectral.KGridCut (1/Angstrom) around the single point of Spectral.Path, which
# with Spectral.UseCoordinates .true. is a Cartesian photoelectron momentum.
Calculate.SpectralEnergyCut .true.
Spectral.WeiKu .true.

Diag.KGrid 181 181 1
Spectral.KGridCut 1.75
Spectral.UseCoordinates .true.
&begin Spectral.Path 1
0.0 0.0 0.0   # center of the map: Gamma
&end Spectral.Path

# The intensity of the first energy plane is the map; it sits exactly at Spectral.Emin, in units
# of g0, here -3.5 eV measured from the charge neutrality point (the bands are symmetric about
# it, unlike the +-0.6 eV shifted B and N site energies). This energy lies between the valence
# band top of -2.49 eV at K and the saddle point of -3.82 eV at M, which is why the map shows
# six separate hole pockets around the K points; at -4.0 eV, below the saddle point, the contour
# has merged into one web around the zone boundary. The second plane is a dummy
# 12*Kubo.Epsilon higher; only the first plane is used. States within Spectral.energyGridResolution
# (eV) of a plane energy contribute.
Kubo.NumberofEnergyPoints 2
Spectral.Emin 0-3.5/2.88945
Spectral.Emax 0-3.5/2.88945+0.24
Kubo.Epsilon 0.02
Spectral.energyGridResolution 0.2

TB.NeighLevels 1
Neigh.CompareAll .true.
Stack.NonBulkSmall .true.

Output.WriteDataFiles .false.
WritePos .false.
